==living_room==
Gary and Issac are going on their first date. Gary wants to find a great place to take 
Issac to impress him, but doesn't know what Issac likes. Where should they go?

There are four different places to choice from.

 + [Take Issac to the bowling alley]->bowling_alley
 + [Take Issac dancing] ->dancing
 + [Take Issac to karaokee]->karaokee
 + [Take Issac on a picnic] ->picnic


== bowling_alley ==
Gary and Issac end up at the bowling alley. It seemed like fun at first, but then it start getting to loud and crowded, also Issac hurt his hand lifting the ball. Issac looked like he had fun, but I don't think he wants to have a second date.
    +[Start Over] -> living_room
    
    
    
    ==dancing==
    Gary and Issac go dancing. It was tons of fun! The 2 seemed to have had a wonderful time dancing together and Issac looks super happy to go on a second date!
    ->END
    +[Start over]->living_room
    
    
    ==karaokee==
    Gary and Issac decide to go to karaokee together. Gary goes and sings and nice ballad for Issac. It wasn't the best, but Issac still seemed to be moved by it. Issac decided to sing and blew the crowd away with his voice. Everyon in the karaokee place complemented all night, but made gary self-conscious. After the date Gary didn't talk to Issac much anymore.
    +[Start Over]-> living_room
    
    
    ==picnic==
Gary takes Issac on a nice picnic in the park. While there and Ice Cream truck comes along, wanting inmpress Issac, he decides to get Issac and him and ice cream. What should he get him? 
+[Get chocolate]->chocolate
+[Get strawberry]->strawberry
+[Get vanilla]->vanilla 



==chocolate==
Gary decides to get Issac chocolate, which is his favorite. Gary and Issac sit by the lake and enjoy their ice cream together while watching the sun set. this looks like this is the beginning of a beautiful realationship.
->END



==strawberry==
Gary decides to get Issac strawberry, unfortunately Issac is severely allergic to strawberry. Gary and Issac end up heading to the hospital and end the date from there.
+[Start Over]->picnic



==vanilla==
Gary decides to get Issac vanilla. It's not the best, but still good. Gary and Issac enjoy their ice cream while planning on where there next date should be.
+[Start Over]->living_room




